A3	INTEGER	"I feel others'' emotions" rated on a five point scale (1-5;0 if missed). 1 was labeled as "strongly disagree", 2 was labeled as "disagree", 3 was labeled as "neither agree not disagree", 4 was labeled as "agree" and 5 was labeled as "strongly agree".
A4	INTEGER	"I take an interest in other people''s lives" rated on a five point scale (1-5;0 if missed). 1 was labeled as "strongly disagree", 2 was labeled as "disagree", 3 was labeled as "neither agree not disagree", 4 was labeled as "agree" and 5 was labeled as "strongly agree".
