B2	INTEGER	"I know the answers to many questions" rated on a five point scale (1-5;0 if missed). 1 was labeled as "strongly disagree", 2 was labeled as "disagree", 3 was labeled as "neither agree not disagree", 4 was labeled as "agree" and 5 was labeled as "strongly agree".
B3	INTEGER	"I tend to analyze things" rated on a five point scale (1-5;0 if missed). 1 was labeled as "strongly disagree", 2 was labeled as "disagree", 3 was labeled as "neither agree not disagree", 4 was labeled as "agree" and 5 was labeled as "strongly agree".
B4	INTEGER	"I use my brain" rated on a five point scale (1-5;0 if missed). 1 was labeled as "strongly disagree", 2 was labeled as "disagree", 3 was labeled as "neither agree not disagree", 4 was labeled as "agree" and 5 was labeled as "strongly agree".
B5	INTEGER	"I learn quickly" rated on a five point scale (1-5;0 if missed). 1 was labeled as "strongly disagree", 2 was labeled as "disagree", 3 was labeled as "neither agree not disagree", 4 was labeled as "agree" and 5 was labeled as "strongly agree".
B6	INTEGER	"I counter others'' arguments" rated on a five point scale (1-5;0 if missed). 1 was labeled as "strongly disagree", 2 was labeled as "disagree", 3 was labeled as "neither agree not disagree", 4 was labeled as "agree" and 5 was labeled as "strongly agree".
B7	INTEGER	"I reflect on things before acting" rated on a five point scale (1-5;0 if missed). 1 was labeled as "strongly disagree", 2 was labeled as "disagree", 3 was labeled as "neither agree not disagree", 4 was labeled as "agree" and 5 was labeled as "strongly agree".
B8	INTEGER	"I weigh the pros against the cons" rated on a five point scale (1-5;0 if missed). 1 was labeled as "strongly disagree", 2 was labeled as "disagree", 3 was labeled as "neither agree not disagree", 4 was labeled as "agree" and 5 was labeled as "strongly agree".
